        "\\section{Introduction}\n",
        "Large language models (LLMs), such as GPT~\\citep{radfordimproving, radfordlanguage, brown2020language, openai2023} and PaLM~\\citep{chowdhery2022palm, anil2023palm2}, have exhibited remarkable capabilities of reasoning and instruction-following across a wide range of tasks~\\citep{huang2023reasoning}.\n",
