        "For complicated tasks, LLM-based autonomous agents integrate LLMs with various external tools (APIs), generating solutions that involve intermediate reasoning steps~\\citep{schick2023toolformer, lu2023chameleon, patil2023gorilla, qin2023toolllm}.\n",
        "Given a problem description, the goal of an agent is to determine a chain of API function calls that can be executed sequentially toward a valid solution.\n",
