        "\\section{\\method: A Tree Search Perspective on External Tool Use}\\label{sec:method}\n",
        "In this section, we introduce the \\method that enables LLM-based agents to efficiently navigate the action space to identify a valid solution path for problem-solving (Figure~\\ref{fig:overview}).\n",
