            "\\appendix\n",
            "\\section{Broader Impacts and Limitations}\n",
            "In this study, we introduce \\method, an efficient tree search-based planning algorithm\n",
            "for LLMs-based agents tackling challenging tasks involving tool usage. As a flexible plug-and-play framework with compositional planning and reasoning capabilities, \\method holds considerable promise for positive social impact across diverse domains, including but not limited to real-world tool utilization and complex decision-making processes.\n",
            "One potential limitation to consider is that, while the efficiency of our proposed \\method surpasses other tree search methods and is even comparable to closed-loop systems, it still cannot match the efficiency of open-loop systems. Given the demands for efficiency in real-world applications, we intend to further refine our tree structure and search strategy in future work.\n",
            "\n",
